        "start": 431
      },
      "text": "open source spell and grammar checker. It’s being integrated into more and more IDEs so that developers can leverage it alongside their other tools. However, LanguageTool’s creator has explicitly stated,"
    },
    {
      "interpretAs": "",
      "markup": " <a href=\"https://forum.languagetool.org/t/rules-for-markdown/374/2\">",
      "offset": {
